data v1_deletion_critical_path_note: String = "Two serial chains dominate the calendar and RUN IN PARALLEL with each other: (A) emit_import_closure_root + generic_t_rendering -> deep_module_lanes -> emitter_fixed_point (Gate 1; wrap_decision_predicate #6776 and std_dup_assembly_fix #6876 already LANDED) and (B) witness_family_fanout -> ledger_projection + the spine receipts -> ci_floor_cutover (Gate 3; witness_realization_kernel #6879 LANDED, witness_family_fanout DONE — all 9 families green). Gate 2 (the honest frontier) is largely PLACED and independent — only trigger_renegotiation (decided) and the seed-shrink flip wave remain. Everything fans out beside the two chains. v1_quarantine lands when all three gates read done; v1_delete = quarantine + the executed verification ledger green (NO calendar soak). CYCLE-5 REMODEL 2026-07-20: this file is now the FULL three-gate roadmap (operator: 'your job is to get us to a full and confident plan — we can antagonize it — make this a roadmap and the artifact a projection of it'). Every milestone is a brick under a PlanGate with a brick_state and a ConfidenceBasis (basis/risk/antagonize) so each item is attackable; the confidence-probe lane (error-histogram + frontier audit + throwaway peel-ahead) is the antagonizing that fills in the risk/antagonize fields. Chain-A CORRECTION carried forward: the 'FreeMonoid single gate' framing was FALSIFIED — self-emitting is a MULTI-LAYER emit-import-closure peel (FreeMonoid was one layer; #6906's re-probe surfaced nested-struct sibling imports + a distinct generic-T class, now split into generic_t_rendering). Operator rulings 2026-07-20: (1) root-cause the import closure into ONE comprehensive derivation, not a face-by-face peel; (2) cargo-green + witness-green at ALL times — NO mid-peel merges (reverses the #6906 exception); (3) the flip wave is NOT orthogonal (it shares the import-closure root) so it fans out IN PARALLEL with deep_module_lanes right AFTER the root fix, never before. Pole B (ledger_projection) is the genuinely-orthogonal Gate-3 lane runnable now. The three-gate reading is NOT '27/27 modules flipped' — some modules stay SeedRetained by necessity; the bar is emitter fixed point + honest frontier + ledger green."
